    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n41127" root="هرجب" body-key="h">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هِرْجَابٌ</span></b>  and <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هِرجَبٌّ</span> <i>Tall,</i> or <i>long,</i> as an epithet
of a man &amp;c. (K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هِرْجَابٌ</span> A <i>tall,</i> or <i>longbodied,</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَوِيلَة</span>) <i>and bulky,</i> she-camel: (S:) as
also <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هِرجَالٌ</span>: pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هَرَاجِيبُ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هِرْجَابٌ</span> Anything
<i>great, large,</i> or <i>bulky:</i> so in the Moajam: or
<i>extending long, horizontally.</i> (TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b4-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">نَخْلَةٌ</span>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">هِرْجَابٌ</span> <i>A tall palm-tree.</i> (TA.)

